  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$x^2+4 x+2 \\leq y \\leq|x+2|$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.quizrr.in/question-assets/jee_main_pyq/8zqX43zxtI8F365ZPYNKx3yMfeEUGI27LSyQB6Kfw0U.original.fullsize_2.png\">\r\n$\\begin{aligned} & A_1=\\int_{-4}^0\\left[2-\\left(x^2+4 x+2\\right)\\right] d x-\\frac{1}{2} \\times 4 \\times 2 \\\\ & =\\left(\\frac{-x^3}{3}-2 x^2\\right)_{-4}^0-4 \\\\ & =0-\\left(\\frac{64}{3}-32\\right)-4 \\\\ & =32-\\frac{64}{3}-4=\\frac{20}{3}\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
